cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MR Studio, please cite it as below, together with the papers of the methods you used (each analysis report lists them)."
title: "MR Studio: a desktop application for Mendelian randomization with GWAS summary statistics"
abstract: >-
  Free, local, point-and-click desktop application for two-sample, multivariable, bidirectional and mediation Mendelian
  randomization with GWAS summary statistics, for macOS and Windows. Every analysis is written as a replayable R script, and
  every method is validated against published results or the reference package it uses.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Ali Reza"
    family-names: "Soleymani Taloubaghi"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AliiReezaa/mr_studio_repo"
keywords:
  - Mendelian randomization
  - GWAS summary statistics
  - causal inference
  - genetic epidemiology
